@COMPANY_NAME@ @PRODUCT_NAME@ - Linux install notes
==================================================

This zip contains the VST3, the CLAP and the standalone application.

VST3
  Copy the @PRODUCT_NAME@.vst3 folder to ~/.vst3 (or /usr/lib/vst3). It carries
  everything it needs inside the bundle.

CLAP
  Copy @PRODUCT_NAME@.clap to ~/.clap (or /usr/lib/clap) TOGETHER WITH these
  files from the top level of this zip:

    @RUNTIME_FILES@

  The .clap looks for them in its own folder first. If they are missing,
  @PRODUCT_NAME@ still loads, but without the features that need the runtime.

Standalone
  Run the standalone binary from this folder, or keep the same files next to
  it wherever you move it.

One shared copy instead
  Rather than copying the runtime next to every .clap and binary, you can put
  the files above in one of these folders (searched after the folder beside the
  plugin):

    /usr/lib/@SHARED_DIR@/
    /usr/local/lib/@SHARED_DIR@/
    ~/.local/lib/@SHARED_DIR@/

  For example:

    sudo mkdir -p /usr/lib/@SHARED_DIR@
    sudo cp -r <the files above> /usr/lib/@SHARED_DIR@/

The Licenses folder holds third-party notices for the runtime; keep it with it.

@WEBSITE@
